{
  "_note": "各国央行政策利率(国际清算银行 BIS 官方数据接口,WS_CBPOL):当前值 + 上次调整多少基点、在什么时候 + 数据日期。美国还原成目标区间;中国是 BIS 采用的 1 年期 LPR。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "zh",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "语言:文案在取数层按语言出。切语言 = 整盘重取,数据缓存含 locale。没注入 @app 时按英文(overseas-first §2)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "y0",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${nowMs},yyyy)]"
      },
      "_note": "今年(按设备时区;跨年那几个小时差一天无妨:两年的文件都会取)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "y1",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${y0}-1),0)]"
      },
      "_note": "去年。⚠️ 进 URL 的数字过 parseNumber(Android calc 返回 2025.0)。"
    },
    {
      "action": "concurrent",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "pd",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://stats.bis.org/api/v2/data/dataflow/BIS/WS_CBPOL/1.0/D.US+XM+JP+GB+CN+CA+CH+AU?lastNObservations=60&format=csv&detail=dataonly",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "string",
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "pm",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://stats.bis.org/api/v2/data/dataflow/BIS/WS_CBPOL/1.0/M.US+XM+JP+GB+CN+CA+CH+AU?lastNObservations=13&format=csv&detail=dataonly",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "string",
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "日频 60 个观测(~10KB)+ 月频 13 个月(~2KB),并发一次往返。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / concurrent 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(memory actionflow-concurrent-late-merge)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "pok",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(findNotEmpty::(${pd},),FREQ),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${pok},1),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "bis unavailable"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "日频 CSV 取不到 = 失败(G26)。月频缺了只是「上次调整」写 --。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "usD",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pd},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nD\\,US\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nD\\,US\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      },
      "_note": "取出这一国的行并压成「<日期=值>…」(按 REF_AREA 取,不按下标),再剔掉非数值的观测(加拿大等周末写 NaN,2026-10-09 实测):没有这一国时第一次替换不命中、原文原样留着,下面用「整串都是 <日期=数> 记号」判掉。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "usM",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pm},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nM\\,US\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nM\\,US\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmD",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pd},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nD\\,XM\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nD\\,XM\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmM",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pm},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nM\\,XM\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nM\\,XM\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jpD",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pd},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nD\\,JP\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nD\\,JP\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jpM",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pm},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nM\\,JP\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nM\\,JP\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "gbD",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pd},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nD\\,GB\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nD\\,GB\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "gbM",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pm},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nM\\,GB\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nM\\,GB\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cnD",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pd},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nD\\,CN\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nD\\,CN\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cnM",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pm},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nM\\,CN\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nM\\,CN\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "caD",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pd},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nD\\,CA\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nD\\,CA\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "caM",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pm},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nM\\,CA\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nM\\,CA\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "chD",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pd},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nD\\,CH\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nD\\,CH\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "chM",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pm},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nM\\,CH\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nM\\,CH\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "auD",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pd},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nD\\,AU\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nD\\,AU\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "auM",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(findNotEmpty::(${pm},),[\\s\\S]*?((?:\\nM\\,AU\\,[^\\n]*)+)[\\s\\S]*,$1),\\nM\\,AU\\,([0-9-]+)\\,([^\\n]*),<$1=$2>),<[0-9-]+=[^0-9>][^>]*>,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "pd"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "pm"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "usok",
        "value": "$[if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${usD},x),^(?:<[0-9-]+=[0-9.]+>)+$),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "这一国日频是否可用(停发的序列是 NaN,也判掉)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "usL",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${usok},1),replaceAll::(${usD},^[\\s\\S]*=([^>]*)>$,$1),)]"
      },
      "_note": "最新值。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "usLd",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${usok},1),replaceAll::(${usD},^[\\s\\S]*<([0-9-]+)=[^>]*>$,$1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "uspD",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${usok},1),replaceAll::(${usD},^([\\s\\S]*?)(?:<[0-9-]+=${usL}>)+$,$1),)]"
      },
      "_note": "最新值之前的部分:把末尾那段「都等于最新值」的记号整段剥掉(最新值写进正则;值里的小数点在正则里匹配任意字符,对纯数字无害)。非空 = 60 个日观测里调整过。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "usrD",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${usok},1),replaceAll::(${usD},^[\\s\\S]*?((?:<[0-9-]+=${usL}>)+)$,$1),)]"
      },
      "_note": "末尾那段:它的第一个记号的日期 = 这次调整生效的那天。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ushD",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${uspD},__none__),__none__),0,1),1),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "usmOk",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${usok},1),eq::(${ushD},0),matches::(findNotEmpty::(${usM},x),^(?:<[0-9-]+=[0-9.]+>)+$)),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "日观测里没调整过,才去月末值里找。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "uspM",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${usmOk},1),replaceAll::(${usM},^([\\s\\S]*?)(?:<[0-9-]+=${usL}>)+$,$1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "usrM",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${usmOk},1),replaceAll::(${usM},^[\\s\\S]*?((?:<[0-9-]+=${usL}>)+)$,$1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ussM",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${usmOk},1),if::(eq::(${uspM},${usM}),x,if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${uspM},__none__),__none__),0,1),1),m,n)),)]"
      },
      "_note": "月末值:x = 最新月末值与当前值不同(月频还没跟上,判断不了)· m = 找到调整的那个月 · n = 13 个月都没变。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "usP",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ushD},1),replaceAll::(${uspD},^[\\s\\S]*=([^>]*)>$,$1),if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ussM},),m),replaceAll::(${uspM},^[\\s\\S]*=([^>]*)>$,$1),))]"
      },
      "_note": "调整前的值。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "usCd",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ushD},1),replaceAll::(${usrD},^<([0-9-]+)=[\\s\\S]*$,$1),if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ussM},),m),replaceAll::(${usrM},^<([0-9-]+)=[\\s\\S]*$,$1),))]"
      },
      "_note": "调整日期:日频是 YYYY-MM-DD(确切那天),月频是 YYYY-MM(那个月末之前)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "usD"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "usM"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "uspD"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "usrD"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "uspM"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "usrM"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmok",
        "value": "$[if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${xmD},x),^(?:<[0-9-]+=[0-9.]+>)+$),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmL",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${xmok},1),replaceAll::(${xmD},^[\\s\\S]*=([^>]*)>$,$1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmLd",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${xmok},1),replaceAll::(${xmD},^[\\s\\S]*<([0-9-]+)=[^>]*>$,$1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmpD",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${xmok},1),replaceAll::(${xmD},^([\\s\\S]*?)(?:<[0-9-]+=${xmL}>)+$,$1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmrD",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${xmok},1),replaceAll::(${xmD},^[\\s\\S]*?((?:<[0-9-]+=${xmL}>)+)$,$1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmhD",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${xmpD},__none__),__none__),0,1),1),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmmOk",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${xmok},1),eq::(${xmhD},0),matches::(findNotEmpty::(${xmM},x),^(?:<[0-9-]+=[0-9.]+>)+$)),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmpM",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${xmmOk},1),replaceAll::(${xmM},^([\\s\\S]*?)(?:<[0-9-]+=${xmL}>)+$,$1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmrM",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${xmmOk},1),replaceAll::(${xmM},^[\\s\\S]*?((?:<[0-9-]+=${xmL}>)+)$,$1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmsM",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${xmmOk},1),if::(eq::(${xmpM},${xmM}),x,if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${xmpM},__none__),__none__),0,1),1),m,n)),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmP",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${xmhD},1),replaceAll::(${xmpD},^[\\s\\S]*=([^>]*)>$,$1),if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${xmsM},),m),replaceAll::(${xmpM},^[\\s\\S]*=([^>]*)>$,$1),))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmCd",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${xmhD},1),replaceAll::(${xmrD},^<([0-9-]+)=[\\s\\S]*$,$1),if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${xmsM},),m),replaceAll::(${xmrM},^<([0-9-]+)=[\\s\\S]*$,$1),))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmD"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmM"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmpD"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmrD"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmpM"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "xmrM"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jpok",
        "value": "$[if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${jpD},x),^(?:<[0-9-]+=[0-9.]+>)+$),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jpL",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${jpok},1),replaceAll::(${jpD},^[\\s\\S]*=([^>]*)>$,$1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jpLd",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${jpok},1),replaceAll::(${jpD},^[\\s\\S]*<([0-9-]+)=[^>]*>$,$1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jppD",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${jpok},1),replaceAll::(${jpD},^([\\s\\S]*?)(?:<[0-9-]+=${jpL}>)+$,$1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jprD",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${jpok},1),replaceAll::(${jpD},^[\\s\\S]*?((?:<[0-9-]+=${jpL}>)+)$,$1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jphD",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${jppD},__none__),__none__),0,1),1),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jpmOk",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${jpok},1),eq::(${jphD},0),matches::(findNotEmpty::(${jpM},x),^(?:<[0-9-]+=[0-9.]+>)+$)),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jppM",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${jpmOk},1),replaceAll::(${jpM},^([\\s\\S]*?)(?:<[0-9-]+=${jpL}>)+$,$1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jprM",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${jpmOk},1),replaceAll::(${jpM},^[\\s\\S]*?((?:<[0-9-]+=${jpL}>)+)$,$1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jpsM",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${jpmOk},1),if::(eq::(${jppM},${jpM}),x,if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${jppM},__none__),__none__),0,1),1),m,n)),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "jpP",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${jphD},1),replaceAll::(${jppD},^[\\s\\S]*=([^>]*)>$,$1),if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${jpsM},),m),replaceAll::(${jppM},^[\\s\\S]*=([^>]*)>$,$1),))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
